<Heading>Program Outline</Heading>

FOSS4G 2027 takes place in Bristol, United Kingdom, from Monday 23 to Sunday 29 August 2027.

| Date                  | Session                             | Venue                                                 |
| --------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| Monday 23 August      | Workshops                           | UoB Humanities                                        |
| Tuesday 24 August     | Workshops                           | UoB Humanities                                        |
| Wednesday 25 August   | Conference                          | UoB Wills Memorial and Chemistry Buildings |
| Thursday 26 August    | Conference                          | UoB Wills Memorial and Chemistry Buildings |
| Friday 27 August      | Conference                          | UoB Wills Memorial and Chemistry Buildings |
| Saturday 28 August    | Community Events and Code Sprint    | To be confirmed                                       |
| Sunday 29 August      | Community Events and Code Sprint    | To be confirmed                                       |

## Social Events

| Date                  | Event                   | Time           | Venue                      |
| --------------------- | ----------------------- | -------------- | -------------------------- |
| Monday 23 August      | Informal Social         | 19:00          | White Lion Pub, Clifton    |
| Tuesday 24 August     | B2B Event               | 16:00 - 18:00  | UoB Chemistry Building      |
| Tuesday 24 August     | GeoChicas Take Bristol  | 19:00 - late   | To be confirmed            |
| Wednesday 25 August   | Ice Breaker Social      | 19:00 - late   | Zero Degrees Micro Brewery |
| Thursday 26 August    | [Gala Dinner](/program/gala-dinner) | 19:00 - 01:00  | Ashton Gate Stadium        |

Further details will be announced as the program is finalised.

[Join our Mailing List](https://mailchi.mp/foss4g/mailing-list) to receive updates on the programme.
